<title>MONACO: ATHLETICS-JAPANESE CITY MAEBASHI TO HOST WORLD INDOORS.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-JAPANESE CITY MAEBASHI TO HOST WORLD INDOORS.</headline>
<dateline>MONACO 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Japanese city of Maebashi will host the 1999 world indoor championships, the International Amateur Athletic Federation (IAAF) said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>In a statement the IAAF said Moscow would stage next year's grand prix final.</p>
<p>The decisions were announced on the second day of an IAAF council meeting at the world governing body's headquarters.</p>
</text>
